0 -14 Td
(into an INSERT statement, enabling SQL injection to create arbitrary accounts or corrupt) Tj
0 -14 Td
(schema state. The flow also leaked whether an email already existed, which facilitated) Tj
0 -14 Td
(account enumeration for credential stuffing.) Tj
0 -14 Td
( ) Tj
0 -14 Td
