0 -14 Td
(enumerate legitimate users for targeted phishing.) Tj
0 -14 Td
( ) Tj
0 -14 Td
(Remediation: `register.php` now filters and normalises inputs, enforces password complexity,) Tj
0 -14 Td
(and executes both uniqueness checks and the final insert using prepared statements. If an) Tj
0 -14 Td
(address already belongs to an OAuth user, the response instructs the visitor to authenticate) Tj
0 -14 Td
(via the linked provider, removing the oracle.) Tj
0 -14 Td
( ) Tj
0 -14 Td
